  "body": "## What\nBumps `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` from 17 to 18 (one line, nothing else).\n\n## Why\nPR #1117 took PROCESS_VERSION 17. PR #930 (merged as 49799c64) also changed a process file (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`: rows for `set_tool_holder` and `list_holder_library`) while the number stayed 17, because both PRs changed 16 -> 17 and git merged the identical change. AGENTS.md says the second to merge takes the next number, so forks that already synced at 17 will not pull #930's change until the number moves.\n\n## Files only, no build\nOnly `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` changes. No cargo run.\n\n## What a fork must do\nPull the process files: `git fetch upstream` then `git checkout upstream/main -- AGENTS.md .claude/agents .claude/skills .claude/PROCESS_VERSION xtask .cargo/config.toml scripts/gate.ps1 scripts/gate.sh scripts/release.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.sh`, then commit on a `process-sync` branch as `chore(process): sync process files to upstream PROCESS_VERSION 18`. The announcement and the full steps are in pinned issue #681.\n\nChangelog: none\n",
